# The dev image (docker/dev.Dockerfile, context = repo root) only copies the GLIM forks and its
# entrypoint; everything else (OmniLRS, .git, runs, build trees) stays out of the build context.
*
!astrobot-lab/src/glim
!astrobot-lab/src/glim_ros2
!docker/dev_entrypoint.sh
astrobot-lab/src/glim*/.git
